      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent high-level overview, but for a seminar-level discussion, I need more depth. Could you expand on the specific legal methodologies used by each side? Specifically, I'd like to see the historical/textual arguments that bolster the originalist position, and the frameworks used by living constitutionalists to justify why the text should evolve.",
